# Build context of apps/cloud/Dockerfile. BuildKit (docker build, docker compose, Coolify) reads this file instead of
# the root .dockerignore when it builds this Dockerfile. Keep local state, build output and secrets out, and keep the
# package.json of every workspace package: pnpm checks the lockfile against the whole workspace.

# Dependencies, build output and local data
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/dist-cloud
**/.data
**/target
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Secrets and local environment
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.dev.vars
**/.secrets.local
**/.wrangler
.godmode
*.godmode-backup

# Not needed to build the cloud
.git
.github
.omc
.claude
docs
videos
site
tasks
idea.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
apps/mobile
apps/desktop/src-tauri
apps/website/*
!apps/website/package.json
packages/core/*
!packages/core/package.json
apps/cloud/Dockerfile
apps/cloud/Dockerfile.dockerignore
apps/cloud/docker-compose.yaml
apps/cloud/docker-compose.override.yaml
apps/cloud/README.md
